			x: -4.5d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Your Guide to Greed"
			description: [
				"&5So, as we mentioned Bandit, the Herald is the FOP's CEO inside the game. So defeating him means ye got rid of the CEO."
				""
				"&dThe CEO isn't really gone, just sort of... locked out of his accounts, in a way. But that means the FOP will be scrambling to try getting rid of you."
				""
				"&5Aye, too bad Pandora's Box has been opened. Well, supply line, I guess."
				""
				"&dClose enough. On that note, I've finished coding up the latest piece of Vault Gear, Bandit. It's called a Vault Map. I've added them to Mr Greedy's Shop, so that the FOPGame Server doesn't tag them as malicious."
				""
				"&5Think of it like a Treasure Map, except it'll be showing ye what the objective will be, and what Modifiers ye'll be adding."
				""
				"&dThere's multiple tiers, each one has a number of modifiers on it. You'll want to make sure all are full before you use the map."
			]
