		{
			title: "A Map to Wonders, a Map to Dangers"
			icon: "luphieclutteredmod:luphie_antique_map"
			x: -2.25d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "A Best Laid Plan"
			description: [
				"&dTo run a Mapped Vault, you need to add the Vault Map to a Vault Crystal in a Crystal Modification Table. You should add the map last, as once applied to the Crystal it will become unmodifiable."
				""
				"&5Mapped Vaults will be more difficult than yer standard Vaults. New themes, new mobs, new loot ye can ONLY find in Mapped Vaults!"
				""
				"&dIt is highly recommended that you use the Vault Artisan Table to fill any empty slots in your Vault Map before applying it to a Vault Crystal. If you don't, well...."
				""
				"&5Think of em of having a bit of the Monkey Paw in em. If ye don't, ye might not like what happens."
			]
			dependencies: ["64E050541DAAF09C"]
