		{
			title: "Task Corrupted Succesfully "
			x: -2.25d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Falling Apart"
			description: [
				"&5There is a special type of Objective, quite difficult to tackle but the only way to obtain certain materials."
				""
				"&dThey are called Corrupted objectives, and are obtained with a special seal you apply to your Crystal."
				""
				"&5When ye Corrupt a Crystal, the objective will be set to Corrupted, and the Theme will be set to Lost Void."
				""
				"&dWhen you enter this corrupted Vault, your view will be heavily altered. &r&l(This special view can be disabled by hitting F4 if it is causing you visual or performance problems.)"
				""
				"&5Corrupted Objective is a very difficult objective, be warned as the longer ye are in the Vault, the more difficult it will become. I shall not say more than to warn ye of this, it must be experienced first hand."
				""
				"&dThis seal ONLY obtained in Mapped Vaults, but its not the only way to Corrupt your crystal...."
			]
