			subtitle: "Think Smarter"
			description: [
				"&5Bandit, when ye hit Level 100, ye can start finding Arcane Essence in completion crates."
				""
				"&dArcane Essence is used to craft Expertise Orbs, which let you increase your Expertise points beyond level 100."
				""
				"&5With enough time and work, ye can unlock ALL of the Expertises!"
