		{
			title: "Open the Gates of Greed"
			x: -9.0d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "An Endless Cycle"
			description: [
				"&dBandit, once the Herald is defeated, you'll gain the ability to tackle the endgame : Greed. "
				""
				"&5The final tab in the Vault Hunters GUI is the Greed Tab, which should now be activated. Ye can begin the first Greed Trial."
				""
				"&dYou can only face the Greed Trial alone, so prepare accordingly. Make sure your gear and skills are set for a big boss fight."
				""
				"&5The Vessel is an undefeatable boss the FOP came up with to test player's strength. "
				""
				"&dDon't feel bad if you don't last long, they made it quite unfair. Your goal is not only to last as long as you can against it, but also to damage it as much as possible to get through its \"Phases\"."
				""
				"&5Ye are rewarded Greed Coins depending on both of those, which can be used to purcase special Greed items."
			]
			dependencies: ["1E1457C794B6792E"]
			id: "132488F801769ED4"
