		}
		{
			x: -6.75d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Phenomenal Power, Itty Bitty Living Space"
			description: [
				"&5Defeating the Greed Trial the first time will unlock the first Greed tier, as well as give ye a Greedy Anchor."
				""
				"&dThe Greedy Anchor is the home of Mr Greedy, an NPC shopkeep who offers you various Greed related things. This is the FOP's post endgame, Bandit, an endless loop of gathering more and more materials and power."
				""
				"&5Aye, it never ends. As ye tackle Greed Vaults and get more Greed Coins, ye can spend em at Mr Greedy's shop, which gains more item slots the higher Greed tier you are."
				""
				"&dMr Greedy also offers various Quests for you to do to earn Reputation, which is needed to progress to higher Greed tiers (along with levels, of course)."
				""
				"&5And finally, Mr Greedy offers ye Challenge Crystals for reputation as well. These have specific modfiers on them to make them, well, a challenge."
			]
			dependencies: ["132488F801769ED4"]
