		{
			title: "The Greed Tree"
			icon: "botania:gaia_head"
			x: -4.5d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&5Once ye finish the first Greed Trial, the Greed tree will open up, and ye'll receive three Greed points to spend as ye like."
				""
				"&dThe Greed Tree has three skill sections : Utility, Defensive, and Offensive. You can hover over a node to see what it does, and click it to spend your Greed Point in it. "
				""
				"&5To get more Greed points, ye'll need to level and gain enough reputation to take the next Greed Trial, which will advance ye to the next Greed tier."
			]
