				"&dAside from the Greed Trials, another way to gain Greed Coins is by using the Greed Cauldron."
				""
				"&5The Greed Cauldron will ask for Vault materials, such as vault burgers, vault gems, etc. When ye feed it the shown item, ye'll receive Greed Coins as payment."
				""
				"&dNote that the Greed Cauldron scales just like your Vault Crystals do. The more you feed it, the more expensive it becomes."
