				"&5When ye activate Greed, all of yer Vaults become Greed vaults. All mobs become stronger, and ye'll have Greed Assassins stalking ye."
				""
				"&dGreed Assassins have a chance of spawning every time you kill a mob. They will spawn nearby, glow brightly, and charge at you. They are like supercharged Champions, with their own abilities. Be careful with them, Bandit!"
				""
				"&5Defeating a Greed Assassin will get ye some Greed Coins and Reputation."
