			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Carved in Power"
			description: [
				"&dBandit, I have an idea for a way to...modify your Vault Abilities. Let me just....okay, Mr Greedy's shop offers a new kind of item : Etchings."
				""
				"&5Ah, brought that system back, eh sis? Well, Bandit, etchings are used to modify yer abilities in various powerful ways. Make Arcane Rail or Ice Bolt pierce through mobs. Make Dash Warp cause a Nova explosion wherever ye teleport to. And many many others."
				""
				"&dEtchings are applied to Vault Gear using an Etching Application Table. Etchings can only be applied to Vault Gear related to the etching type : Offensive on Vault Weapons, Defensive on Vault Armor, and Utility on Vault Off-Hand gear."
			]
