		{
			title: "A Vault of Your Own"
			x: -4.5d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Does Feng Shui Include Mushrooms?"
			description: [
				"&dBro, I found some of that old code for those Paradox Vaults the FOPGame Server used to have. I think we can use them to really help supercharge Bandit....Here, Mr Greedy's Shop now has Super Catalysts and Super Inscriptions. You can use these to make yourself a Personal Vault."
				""
				"&5Oh I see sis...let's see...to design yer Personal Vault, get an Architect's Workbench. Ye can place down Super Inscriptions to set what rooms will appear and Super Catalysts to set what bonus modifiers yer Personal Vault will have."
				""
				"&dEach Super Inscription added to your Personal Vault will add more Time to your Vault Timer, so balancing Common Rooms and special rooms is important."
				""
				"&5Ye can insert a Level 100 Vault Crystal and some Echo Gems to create a Personal Vault Crystal."
				""
				"&dPersonal Vaults can only be run once every 20 hours. Any faster, and the system will trip some alarms on all of us."
			]
